flowchart TD
A[Open join link/code] --> B[User gesture enables audio]
B --> C[Connect control plane]
C --> D[Authenticate/join]
D --> E[Receive track offer]
E --> F[Fetch + verify + decode locally]
F --> G[Clock sampling]
G --> H{READY?}
H -- No --> F
H -- Yes --> I[Wait for authoritative future anchor]
I --> J[Schedule local audio]
J --> K[Report phase/latency/transport telemetry]
K --> L{Drift or mismatch?}
L -- Yes --> M[Bounded rate correction / re-lock]
M --> K
L -- No --> K
